      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i keep getting this weird burning/heavy feeling in the middle of my chest lately. it mostly happens when i'm doing stuff like walking up the stairs or moving around a lot, but if i just sit down for a bit it goes away pretty quick. thinking it might just be bad heartburn... should i just take some extra antacids or something to see if that fixes it?",
