    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look im just trying to figure out what to do tonight... i'm not saying i'm having a heart attack, i'm saying it comes and goes and only happens when i'm active. if it was a real heart attack i'd be dying right now wouldnt i? it feels so much more like my stomach hurting. what if i just took a really high dose of some antacids tonight to see if i can knock the pain out? would that be okay to do just to see if it helps?",
